{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55123","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵行次，四季狱神凶。\n春卯（京本注：「夏午。\n」）顺（京本注：「四季。\n」）雷（京本作「来」）居震位，辰年艮（京本作「日辰年」）上忌相逢，临着失勳功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}